Wat je gaat doen As a Production Operator, you are an important part of the production process. You make sure the machines are running properly and that production continues according to schedule. 
Your responsibilities include:- Operating and setting up production machines;
- Changing and adjusting machines between different production runs;
- Performing quality checks on the products;
- Identifying and solving minor technical issues;
- Cleaning and maintaining the machines;
- Recording production data, malfunctions and solutions;
- Thinking along about improvements to the production process;
- Working closely with your colleagues to keep production running smoothly.You will work in a 3-shift schedule:- 06:00 – 14:00
- 14:00 – 22:00
- 22:00 – 06:00The factory operates from Sunday evening until Friday evening.

   Wat we je bieden As a Production Operator at Intersnack, you can expect good employment conditions and plenty of opportunities to develop yourself:- €3390-€4220 gross per month, including a 19.5% shift allowance;
- A full-time position of 40 hours per week;
- A 3-shift schedule;
- Temporary contract with the possibility of a permanent contract;
- €0.22 travel allowance per kilometre;
- Choice between weekly or four-weekly payment;
- Internal training and development opportunities;
- An informal working environment with friendly colleagues;
- Free coffee, tea and hot chocolate during your shifts;
- And regularly something tasty from the factory.

   Functie-eisen We are looking for someone who enjoys working with machines and already has experience in a production environment. You preferably have:- Experience as a Production Operator, Machine Operator, Machine Technician or Production Worker;
- Experience in the food industry is a strong advantage;
- At least MBO 1/2 working and thinking level or equivalent practical experience;
- Technical experience and an interest in machinery;
- Good command of the English language;
- Willingness to work full-time
